---
/**
 * The optional newsletter box on DRIFT's trial forms (TV walk P05, Dan 2026-11-04): the trial no longer joins
 * anyone to the list; only this box, ticked, does (capture.ts reads [data-drift-consent]; no `name`, so it never
 * rides in the /form-once fields). The words are the licence worker's MARKETING_CONSENT_TEXT, as on
 * TrialGateModal, so the stored consent matches what was shown. A grid child of its form, on a row of its own.
 */
---
<label class="d-consent">
  <input type="checkbox" data-drift-consent />
  <span>Also send me new-plugin drops and demo codes (optional)</span>
</label>
